# Tech

A modern technology landing page project built with HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.

## Features
- Responsive layout
- Modern tech-inspired UI
- Clean navigation
- Service and about sections
- Contact section

## Project Structure
- `index.html` — page structure
- `styles.css` — design and layout
- `script.js` — small interactive behavior

